 "notes": [
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 48,
   "sec": 6,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Kalam's other firsts:** As project director of SLV-III, he saw it put the Rohini satellite into orbit (July 1980); in June 2006 he became the first Indian Head of State to fly in a fighter aircraft (Su-30MKI)."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 50,
   "sec": 2,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Massive retaliation:** a nuclear first strike on India will be met with massive retaliation designed to cause unacceptable damage."
  },
  {
   "book": 5,
   "row": 50,
   "sec": 7,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **CTBT and testing:** India keeps a voluntary moratorium on nuclear tests (since 1998) and will not sign the CTBT unless it is tied to time-bound global nuclear disarmament."
  }
 ],
